# The build context of deploy/Dockerfile is the repository root; keep it to sources.
.git
.github
.vscode
.devcontainer
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
runtime-home
# Task worktrees live under worktrees/ and are whole checkouts: without this the context carries a
# second copy of the repository (plus its node_modules) into every build.
worktrees
docs
*.md
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
